abstract: >
  GoldenFloat (GF) is a family of seven narrow floating-point
  formats parameterized by φ ≈ 1.618. We prove that φ is
  unique fixed point of balancing recursion f(x)=(x+x⁻¹+1)/2
  (Theorem 3, zero free parameters). T27 provides spec-first
  development with formal verification.
keywords:
  - golden ratio
  - floating point
  - ternary computing
  - GoldenFloat
  - phi
  - number format
  - t27
  - tri CLI
  - Coq
  - formal verification
  - Theorem 3
  - generative mechanism
